  "bodyHash": "6355967f60758f7a",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓我睡覺</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 讓你完全掌控 Minecraft 的睡眠體驗。🌙 從限制入睡時間到醒來後精神煥發，幾乎所有睡眠相關功能都可以客製化，以更好地契合你的世界與玩法風格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">找不到害你睡不著的怪物？床應該使用時卻失效？希望睡眠能治療、清除效果，或是讓體驗更順暢？這個模組讓夜晚變得更有彈性、更少挫敗感，並擁有更多可設定選項。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧入睡：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 下雨也能睡覺、瞬間醒來，並享受平滑的入睡動畫。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👁️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">揭露附近怪物：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 妨礙睡眠的怪物會短暫發光並播放環境音效，使你更容易找到它們。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">😌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">放鬆式怪物檢查：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 持續存在、無法接近或被動的附近怪物，在睡覺時可選擇忽略。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛏️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;\">靈活的床規則：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 移除範圍、障礙物或怪物檢查限制，讓床的使用彈性更大。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;\">治療性睡眠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 配置睡眠後的恢復值，例如醒來時補健康或調整飢餓值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☀️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;\">天氣控制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.\";> 醒來時可選擇重置天氣循環，帶來更寧靜的早晨。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;\">醒來效果：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 透過 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:wake_up_effects</span></code> 生物效果 <a href=\"https://docs.neoforged.net/docs/resources/server/datamaps/\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">數據圖表</span></a> 以及 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:cleared_when_waking_up</span></code> 生物效果標籤，清除或施加效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;\">資料驅動的相容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 透過標籤控制特殊行為，例如 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:never_prevents_player_rest</span></code> 和 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:no_sleeping_interruption</span></code>，實現無縫的模组支援。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CLIENT 為安裝選項，SERVER 必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組提供設定，可以直接在遊戲中透過模组選單進行設定（需要在 Fabric 上安裝由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a> 開發的 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a>）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本編輯手動設定，所有檔案位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code>，檔名依設定類型分別為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非所有模組都會包含所有類型檔案，甚至可能沒有任何檔案。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vikestep\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">VikeStep</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其現今已過時的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nearby-mob-finder\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Nearby Mob Finder</span></a> 模组，啟發了光暈功能的設計。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spiky-spikes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/spikyspikes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/all-the-heads\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
